<title>UK: Kotobukiya sets $60 million five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Kotobukiya sets $60 million five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager LTCB International Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   Kotobukiya Co Ltd</p>
<p> AMT    $60 MLN	 BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +0.325    PAY DATE    30.JUN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON PAYING 1M LIBOR +0.325</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
